{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31060","headline":"相国陇西公南征能以留务独宿府城作 · 薛能","name":"相国陇西公南征能以留务独宿府城作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾君贤相事南征，独宿军厨负请缨。\n灯室卧孤如怨别，月阶簪草似临行。\n高墉撼铎思巴栈，老木嘷风念野营。\n殊忆好僧招不及，夜来仓卒鏁严城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31060.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31060","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}